+  'revert the HA-DEGRADED-READ-1 change (qnfo-fleet-dashboard back to the version before 1.52.0) and run the Rollback line of migrations/2026-10-19-rum-degraded-read-guard.sql (restores the re-armed contract from bak_20261019_rum_guard_contracts, deletes the control, the failure mode and its detector)',
+  'the fleet no longer publishes, or reopens issues on, a partial Web Analytics read, and every audience ledger row says whether it passed the guard',
