+  'qnfo-audit D1 (cloud_ops_events, metric_registry, metric_write_audit_log, reach_signals, metric_history, v_metric_trigger_state, agent_issues, remediation_contracts, control_registry, failure_modes, decision_log: columns, triggers and values read-only), qnfo-fleet-dashboard worker.js on origin/main, human-audience.test.mjs run against 1.51.0 and 1.52.0 and mutated copies of 1.52.0, rum-degraded-read-guard.test.mjs on node:sqlite fixtures of the live columns, the 13 real daily audience rows of 2026-10-06 to 10-18 replayed through the real refreshHumanAudience'
